 SG_ StatusConst : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" DISPLAY

BO_ 755 DME_ManifoldPressure: 8 DME
 SG_ ManifoldPressureAbs : 32|16@1+ (0.5,0) [0|32767.5] "mbar" DISPLAY

