CM_ "Reverse-engineered by TZey on a 2014 BMW F22 220d (N47D20C). Single 500 kbit/s bus, captured passively in listen-only mode. F-series scaling: do not reuse on E-series, the fuel sender curve in particular is different.";
CM_ BO_ 165 "Approx 50 Hz. DLC 8 confirmed.";
CM_ SG_ 165 EngineSpeed "Bytes 5-6 little-endian, quarter-rpm. The common (B6<<8)+B7 decode is WRONG: it quantises to 64 rpm steps and reads about 60 rpm with the engine stopped. Firmware forces values under 100 to zero.";
CM_ SG_ 165 StatusConst "Byte 7. Constant 0xF1 on this car. Not part of the rpm value.";
CM_ BO_ 755 "Only DLC >= 6 was confirmed; declared 8 here. Scaling is well supported by observed behaviour but not verified against a scan tool.";
CM_ SG_ 755 ManifoldPressureAbs "Absolute, not gauge. Subtract an ambient reference sampled while rpm is 0 to get boost. Observed: idle 0 to +0.05 bar, overrun dip about -0.25 bar, full load about +0.9 bar. Drifts with weather when the engine is off, which is what identifies it as a real sensor.";
CM_ BO_ 708 "Approx 7 Hz. Only DLC >= 2 confirmed; declared 8 here.";
CM_ SG_ 708 FuelCounter "Rolling 16-bit fuel integrator, approx 1 microlitre per count. Absolute value is meaningless; difference it over time. Must be handled wrap-safe. 278 counts/s equals 1.0 L/h at warm idle. Frozen with the engine off, drops to about zero on overrun fuel cut.";
CM_ BO_ 1017 "Only DLC >= 6 confirmed; declared 8 here.";
CM_ SG_ 1017 VacuumDomainPressure "Byte 3. A pressure in the vacuum domain that clamps between 112 and 118. This is NOT boost, do not use it as such.";
CM_ BO_ 417 "DLC 5 confirmed.";
CM_ BO_ 816 "Approx every 10 seconds. DLC 8 confirmed.";
CM_ SG_ 816 FuelTotalDamped "Integer litres, heavily damped and lags the real level.";
CM_ SG_ 816 FuelLevelLeft "Cluster's computed level for the left tank lobe, truncated to 0.5 L steps. The cluster's internal 0.1 L value is never broadcast. Values above 90 are not level readings.";
CM_ SG_ 816 FuelLevelRight "Cluster's computed level for the right tank lobe, truncated to 0.5 L steps.";
CM_ BO_ 841 "5 Hz. DLC 5 confirmed.";
CM_ SG_ 841 FuelSenderRaw1 "Raw sender counts, NOT litres. Nonlinear per tank lobe and only the cluster holds the curve. The E9x rule raw/160 = litres is wrong on F-series. To get 0.1 L resolution, anchor these against KOMBI_FuelOdometer half-litre ticks and interpolate.";
CM_ SG_ 841 FuelSenderRaw2 "Second lobe. Which raw field maps to which physical side is not fixed and has to be learned by watching which one moves when a given side ticks.";
CM_ BO_ 760 "DLC 8 confirmed.";
CM_ SG_ 760 Month "High nibble of byte 4.";
CM_ BO_ 304 "Only DLC >= 1 confirmed; declared 8 here.";
CM_ SG_ 304 TerminalStatus "Byte 0. Nonzero means terminal live, 0x00 means off. Individual terminal codes were not decoded. Dips while cranking, so debounce before acting on it.";
